# Third-party licenses: Rust crates

Generated by `scripts/third-party-licenses.sh` with [cargo-about](https://github.com/EmbarkStudios/cargo-about)
from `Cargo.lock`, for the crates compiled into the `quill` binary with default
features on the shipped targets (macOS arm64, Linux x86_64/arm64, Windows x86_64).
Build-only and dev-only crates are excluded. Do not edit by hand.

Native libraries shipped next to the binary (TDLib, OpenSSL, zlib, FFmpeg,
ntgcalls, rlottie, the Visual C++ runtime) and bundled data files are listed in
`THIRD_PARTY.md`, with their license texts under `licenses/`.

